  ('pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 24, 14, 'canon', 'hebrews', 7, 14, 'free', E'Hebrews 7:14 — *it is evident that our Lord sprang out of Juda; of which tribe Moses spake nothing concerning priesthood.* That a king of Judah establishes a new priesthood is the change of priesthood Hebrews declares.'),
