       E'The priests rob the offerings and corrupt the covenant of Levi',
       E'Levi foretells the priests who will be puffed up over their priesthood, rob the offerings of the Lord, teach His commandments out of covetousness, and pollute the holy things — lifting themselves up against the very commands of God. Malachi names this same ruin: the priests who departed from the way and corrupted the covenant of Levi. It ain''t new — the prophet''s lament over the corrupted priesthood is Levi''s own foresight.',
       sv.verse_id, ev.verse_id, 'extras', 87725
