       E'Until He shall again visit you and in pity receive you',
       E'After the dispersion and the curse among the Gentiles, Levi promises the Lord shall again visit Israel and in pity receive them. Moses sealed the same hope: that the Lord will turn the captivity and gather His own from all the nations. It ain''t new — the visiting mercy that gathers the scattered is the restoration promised in the Torah.',
       sv.verse_id, ev.verse_id, 'extras', 87778
