  ('pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 45, 6, 'canon', 'leviticus', 18, 24, 'free', E'Leviticus 18:24 — *Defile not ye yourselves in any of these things: for in all these the nations are defiled which I cast out before you.* The Canaanite "wickedness" Judah names is the defilement the Law commands Israel to shun.')
