       E'The kings as sea-monsters and the false prophets like tempests',
       E'Judah prophesies that the latter kings shall be as sea-monsters swallowing men like fishes, plundering houses and lands, and that false prophets shall rise like tempests to persecute all righteous men. It ain''t new — Jeremiah names the prophets who run unsent, and the Master warns of false prophets in sheep''s clothing who inwardly are ravening wolves.',
       sv.verse_id, ev.verse_id, 'extras', 88378
