  ('pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 79, 3, 'canon', 'ephesians', 4, 25, 'free', E'Eph 4:25 — *Wherefore putting away lying, speak every man truth with his neighbour: for we are members one of another.* The same pairing of truth against lying that Dan calls good and well pleasing to God.'),
