  ('pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 79, 3, 'canon', 'james', 1, 20, 'free', E'Jas 1:20 — *For the wrath of man worketh not the righteousness of God.* James, like Dan, sets anger over against the truth that pleases God.'),
