       E'Reading in the writing of Enoch, Naphtali foresees Israel departing after the lawlessness of the Gentiles, brought into captivity, then made few, returning to acknowledge the LORD their God who brings them back according to His abundant mercy — until the compassion of the LORD shall come, a man working righteousness and mercy unto them that are afar off and them that are near. This is the long-foretold shape of the scattering and gathering. It ain''t new — Moses promised that the LORD would gather Israel from the outmost parts of heaven, Ezekiel that He would make the two houses one, and the apostle that peace is preached to them afar off and to them that are near.',
       sv.verse_id, ev.verse_id, 'extras', 89200
  FROM _session413_t89_lookup sv, _session413_t89_lookup ev
 WHERE sv.edition_slug='pseudepigrapha' AND sv.book_slug='testaments-xii' AND sv.chapter_number=89 AND sv.verse_number=1
   AND ev.edition_slug='pseudepigrapha' AND ev.book_slug='testaments-xii' AND ev.chapter_number=89 AND ev.verse_number=5
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

