       E'Drive forth hatred which is of the devil — cleave to the love of God',
       E'Gad describes hatred mating with lying, kindling wrath and stirring up war, and bids his children drive it forth and cleave to the love of God. The apostle Paul gives the same charge — put away all bitterness, wrath, anger, and evil speaking. It ain''t new — Gad''s plea to cast out hatred is Paul''s word to the saints, spoken long before.',
       sv.verse_id, ev.verse_id, 'extras', 89453
  FROM _session413_t99_lookup sv, _session413_t99_lookup ev
 WHERE sv.edition_slug='pseudepigrapha' AND sv.book_slug='testaments-xii' AND sv.chapter_number=99 AND sv.verse_number=1
