  ('pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 139, 3, 'canon', 'deuteronomy', 21, 23, 'free', E'Deut 21:23 — *for he that is hanged is accursed of Elohim (God).* — the Torah''s word on the one hanged on a tree, the curse the lifted-up Lord bears.'),
  ('pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 139, 3, 'canon', 'galatians', 3, 13, 'free', E'Gal 3:13 — *Messiah (Christ) hath redeemed us from the curse of the law, being made a curse for us: for it is written, Cursed is every one that hangeth on a tree.* — the Anointed lifted up upon a tree, bearing the curse for the salvation Benjamin foresees.'),
  ('pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 139, 4, 'canon', 'matthew', 27, 51, 'free', E'Matt 27:51 — *And, behold, the veil of the temple was rent in twain from the top to the bottom.* — the very rending of the veil Benjamin prophesies, "the veil of the temple shall be rent."'),
  -- thread: testaments-xii-139-he-shall-ascend-from-hades-into-heaven
